        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F93PAR, Ornate Parthenon Dummy Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOrnately decorated, Schlage's Parthenon Double Cylinder Handleset is a beautiful example of the exquisite style one might find on the elegant homes of the Hamptons. The antique brass finish only brings out the old world beauty of this handleset. This product is just for looks. It does not lock or latch. It is most often used as a pull to match trim on the inactive side of a double door. It is crafted out of solid brass and features a very easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Cylinder Handleset:</b> Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors and does not function. Does not latch or lock.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Parthenon Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Guaranteed to fit all standard door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Dummy Bowman Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: Antique Brass\r\n<li>Overall Outside Handle Length: 12-2/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Projection: 2-1/10\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Deadbolt Plate Length: 3-3/10\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Deadbolt Plate Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Top Handle Plate Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Top Handle Plate Width: 2-2/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Length: 3-3/10\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Width: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The handleset is only available in Antique Brass (609) finish and the inside trim will match the outside handle.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>This item is Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/schlage-handleset\">Schlage Handleset</a><b>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Parthenon Dummy Handleset, Schlage F93PAR",
                "description": "Parthenon Dummy Handleset Schlage F93PAR - Ornately decorated, Schlage's Parthenon Double Cylinder Handleset is a beautiful example of the exquisite style one might find on the elegant homes of the Hamptons. The antique brass finish only brings out the old world beauty of this handleset. This product is just for looks. It does not lock or latch. It is most often used as a pull to match trim on the inactive side of a double door. It is crafted out of solid brass and features a very easy installation.",
